"{{Term/Store|EX Treasure: Phantasma||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Treasure: Phantasma}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Outpost Ruins}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] is obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding ''[[Misko's EX Journal]]'', which is rumored to be in the [[Outpost Ruins]].<ref>{{Cite|There's a journal that places the locations of the treasure somewhere in the {{Color BotW|Red|Outpost Ruins}}...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading ''Misko's EX Journal'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

Within ''Misko's EX Journal'' are clues to the locations of eight [[Treasure Chest]]s, each containing a priceless relic stolen from [[Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]].<ref>{{Cite|I hid the eight priceless relics I stole from Hyrule Castle in treasure chests... I shall write down their locations. -{{Color BotW|Blue|Misko}}|Misko's EX Journal|BotW}}</ref> The Journal states the [[Armor]] of fierce [[Phantom]]s can be found ruins of a battleground, ceremonial grounds, and where soldiers gathered.<ref>{{Cite|Armor worn by fierce phantoms, feared even by heroes, is hidden {{Color BotW|Red|in the ruins of Hyrule Field}}. Find these pieces {{Color BotW|Red|at a battleground where brave souls tested their skill}}...{{Color BotW|Red|at ceremonial grounds where royal guards are honored}}...and {{Color BotW|Red|at the ruins where the soldiers of Hyrule gathered}}.|Misko's EX Journal|BotW}}</ref>

The [[Phantom Helmet]] can be found in a Treasure Chest buried in the northwest of the [[Coliseum Ruins]]. The Treasure Chest containing the [[Phantom Armor]] is buried in the southeast of the [[Sacred Ground Ruins]]. The [[Phantom Greaves]] are in a [[Treasure Chest]] buried near a wrecked [[Guardian Stalker]] in the southeast of the [[Hyrule Garrison Ruins]]. Each Chest can be dislodged from the ground using the [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]], allowing Link to retrieve the Armor within. The Side Quest is completed once all three pieces of the [[Phantom Equipment]] have been obtained.<ref>{{Cite|You found the treasure that was hidden at Coliseum Ruins, Sacred Grounds Ruins, and Hyrule Garrison Ruins. You obtained the {{Color BotW|Red|Phantom Equipment}}!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

